{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"b9466ca4-404f-4189-8355-3c768e665c25","title":"Three kinds of page, and one rule for choosing","desc":"Notes hold ideas, sources hold other people's work, topics hold the argument together.","updated":1788417991064,"created":1788417991064,"tags":["meta","writing-system"],"custom":{},"fname":"notes.three-kinds-of-page","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"980f11ed293e7214ad200767ffbec832","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.three-kinds-of-page","id":"b9466ca4-404f-4189-8355-3c768e665c25","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.meta","alias":"meta","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.meta"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.three-kinds-of-page","id":"b9466ca4-404f-4189-8355-3c768e665c25","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.writing-system","alias":"writing-system","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.writing-system"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"notes.three-kinds-of-page","id":"b9466ca4-404f-4189-8355-3c768e665c25","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.naming-and-linking","alias":"Naming and linking","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":11,"offset":729},"end":{"line":19,"column":58,"offset":776},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.naming-and-linking"}},{"from":{"fname":"topics.how-this-notebook-works","id":"b43523ba-f71e-4459-bde8-67c52f7ca1dc","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":3,"offset":307},"end":{"line":9,"column":79,"offset":383},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.three-kinds-of-page"},{"from":{"fname":"notes.photos.notation","id":"246da0e6-0ebd-47e9-9d31-7a54a79b8a47","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":66,"column":11,"offset":2075},"end":{"line":66,"column":60,"offset":2124},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.three-kinds-of-page"}],"anchors":{"one-idea-per-note":{"type":"header","text":"One idea per note","value":"one-idea-per-note","line":24,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"28a6a50b-4c15-4c7d-b603-5a1d12809f1c","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"three-kinds-of-page-and-one-rule-for-choosing\">Three kinds of page, and one rule for choosing<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#three-kinds-of-page-and-one-rule-for-choosing\"></a></h1>\n<p>The rule is about authorship. If the words are yours and the idea is yours,\nit's a <strong>note</strong>. If you're recording something someone else made, it's a\n<strong>source</strong>. If you're arranging other pages into an argument, it's a\n<strong>topic</strong>.</p>\n<p>Keeping sources separate from notes is the load-bearing part. A source page\nis allowed to be thin — a link, a date, three sentences of why. A note is\nexpected to make a claim you'd defend. Mixing them produces pages that do\nneither job, and you stop writing because every entry feels like it owes an\nessay.</p>\n<h2 id=\"one-idea-per-note\">One idea per note<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#one-idea-per-note\"></a></h2>\n<p>If a note grows a second heading that could stand alone, split it and link\nthe two. Splitting is cheap; untangling a 2,000-word note two years later is\nnot.</p>\n<p>See also: <a href=\"/IntoTheEtherDocumentationDendron/notes/7a8ae6a4-b61f-4521-9562-2f0ceadede8d\">Naming and linking</a>.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">meta (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">writing-system (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/IntoTheEtherDocumentationDendron/notes/b43523ba-f71e-4459-bde8-67c52f7ca1dc\">How this notebook works</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/IntoTheEtherDocumentationDendron/notes/246da0e6-0ebd-47e9-9d31-7a54a79b8a47\">Marginalia and approval flags</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"28a6a50b-4c15-4c7d-b603-5a1d12809f1c","title":"Notes","desc":"Ideas in my own words, revised over time rather than published once.","updated":1788417991064,"created":1788417991064,"tags":["meta"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"notes","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"1684a548ea270e4f1afc2c89cb1e47c9","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes","id":"28a6a50b-4c15-4c7d-b603-5a1d12809f1c","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.meta","alias":"meta","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.meta"}},{"from":{"fname":"root","id":"03cdc22b-eff8-4e94-bd04-96724d382caa","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":3,"offset":106},"end":{"line":5,"column":18,"offset":121},"indent":[]},"value":"notes"}],"anchors":{},"children":["d2d6721c-74a0-4ce6-aa40-40502d0a2626","7a8ae6a4-b61f-4521-9562-2f0ceadede8d","4ae2c7ca-0db8-4486-b1d3-7027f71420d3","b9466ca4-404f-4189-8355-3c768e665c25"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nIdeas in my own words, revised over time rather than published once. Every\nnote filed under this hierarchy shows up as a child below, and Dendron's\nbacklinks panel shows what links into each one.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":1,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"workspaceVaultSyncMode":"noCommit","journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavior":"childOfDomain"},"scratch":{"name":"scratch","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd.HHmms